==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Sandshrew|83}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Sandshrew}}.
*'''Sand Spray''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fates Collide|Wormadam|44}} from the {{TCG|Fates Collide}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

